<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3792/97  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7352/62  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9514/19  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4445/55  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.79/83   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.8570/80  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1704.1/5.1 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     114.13/23  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.7659/34  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.2683/57  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.6054/74  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.6366/76</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$340.75/05</p>
</text>
